            <p style="font-family:'Mulish',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px;max-width:520px;color:var(--color-text)">The Experiment Beauty Super Saturated is a serum. Our analysis of its <strong style="color:var(--color-text)">20 ingredients</strong> (14 low-risk) rates it <strong style="color:#2f7d4f">Excellent (93/100)</strong>. Based on its ingredients, it looks well-suited to <strong style="color:var(--color-text)">dry skin</strong>.</p>

          <div class="hero2-chips">
            <a href="#full-ingredient" class="hero2-chip" data-ga-section="ingredients_chip">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 2v7.31"/><path d="M14 9.3V1.99"/><path d="M8.5 2h7"/><path d="M14 9.3a6.5 6.5 0 1 1-4 0"/><path d="M5.52 16h12.96"/></svg>
              <strong>20</strong>&nbsp;ingredients
