            <div class="card pfaq" style="margin-bottom:16px">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap" style="gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
      <h3 class="t-h3" style="margin:0">Frequently asked questions</h3>
      <span class="t-caption">answered from the analysis</span>
    </div>
      <details class="pfaq__item">
        <summary class="pfaq__q">Is it fungal-acne (Malassezia) safe?<span class="pfaq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p class="pfaq__a">No — the formula contains at least one ingredient that can feed Malassezia. The flagged entries are marked in the ingredient table above.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pfaq__item">
        <summary class="pfaq__q">Can I use it during pregnancy?<span class="pfaq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p class="pfaq__a">No commonly flagged ingredient classes (retinoids, high-dose salicylic acid, hydroquinone) were found. Still, check with your doctor — this is not medical advice.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pfaq__item">
        <summary class="pfaq__q">Does it contain drying alcohol?<span class="pfaq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p class="pfaq__a">No drying alcohols were found in the ingredient list. The brand also lists it as fragrance-free.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pfaq__item">
        <summary class="pfaq__q">Will it clog pores (comedogenicity)?<span class="pfaq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p class="pfaq__a">Unlikely — the highest comedogenic rating in the formula is 1/5.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="pfaq__item">
        <summary class="pfaq__q">Is it vegan?<span class="pfaq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p class="pfaq__a">Yes — the brand lists this product as vegan.</p>
      </details>
  </div>

